ind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Demo Update - Lost & FoundNewLost & Found: Anything you leave on the train no longer rides away with it. Pallets (and everything stacked on them), tools and trash still in a wagon when the train departs are moved to the Lost & Found spot in the warehouse. When a train pulls in, anything left on the tracks or the dock is moved there too, so the train never drives through your stuff.The first time this happens, a task and an arrow point you to where your things ended up.ImprovementsThe empty-wagon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:59:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036985","verified_at":"2026-10-23T20:11:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4948830-1847286114032814","game_id":"steam-4948830","kind":"announcement","title":"Live Broadcast","summary":"The Dev is playing the demo.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:08:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032814","verified_at":"2026-10-22T17:19:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4948830-1845383656397704","game_id":"steam-4948830","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Demo Update: Full Game Preview, Better Controls, Clearer Screens New The Store now previews full-game items, marked \"Not in demo\": helper robots, the decor roller, the funnel and new decorations. First launch now asks how you like to carry boxes: hold the button or click to latch. Short videos show both. Hammer swings now have impact sounds and dust. Placing furniture or conveyor parts kicks up a little dust. Improvements Rotate items while placing them with the mouse wheel. Device screens use a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T22:08:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397704","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4948830-1845383656389099","game_id":"steam-4948830","kind":"announcement","title":"ROADMAP","summary":"Hello depot workers! The demo is out, and a lot of you have asked what comes next. Here is our roadmap: what's already in the game, what arrives with Early Access and what we plan to build after launch. Items are listed in the order we plan to work on them. Order and scope may change with your feedback, and nothing here is a promise of a date. Done Train deliveries and wagon unloading Scanning, labelling and region taping Owned truck fleet with live map tracking Conveyor network and sorting devi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T12:46:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389099","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4948830-1844751498226175","game_id":"steam-4948830","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update : Fix and UI Improvements","summary":"A New Office PC, a Real Level-Up Moment and a Smoother First Day This update rebuilds the office computer, makes levelling up feel like an event, and polishes the first day on the job. Here is what changed. Office PC Redesign New clean, flat desktop with clearer text and buttons. Every app has a back button (","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T23:36:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226175","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4948830-1844115010498170","game_id":"steam-4948830","kind":"update","title":"Update: General Fixes and Improvements","summary":"This one is mostly about how cargo feels in your hands. Thanks to everyone who sent feedback from the demo; a lot of this came straight from watching where people got stuck. Pallets, reworked E grabs and releases a pallet. While you haul one, both mouse buttons belong to the pallet: LMB always loads, RMB always unloads. No more dropping the pallet by accident. RMB now sets the top parcel down anywhere flat: the floor, a truck bed, a wagon, or on top of another box. Belts and shelves still work a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T00:59:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498170","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4948830-1844115010495391","game_id":"steam-4948830","kind":"announcement","title":"Ukrainian Language + Localization Fixes","summary":"New languageUkrainian (Українська) is now available. The game picks it automatically if your system language is Ukrainian, or you can select it in Settings.Localization fixesFixed milestones, mails, guide cards and item names appearing in English while playing in Turkish.Changing the language mid-game now updates everything right away: objective cards, the \"hold to skip\" line, the radial tool wheel and active tasks no longer stay in the old language.Truck size names (Small / Mid / Long) are now ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T16:31:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495391","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4948830-1844115010492967","game_id":"steam-4948830","kind":"announcement","title":"StowStow demo is live","summary":"Hey! I've been building this warehouse game for a while and today you can finally play a piece of it.You're the guy at the loading dock. Trains bring boxes in, you scan them, slap the right labels on, stack what you can't ship yet, and get the rest onto the right truck before the day ends. Mess up a label and it shows on the receipt.The demo is the first three days. No saving, it just ends. That's on purpose.If you play it, tell me what annoyed you. Seriously, that's the most useful thing right ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T18:25:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492967","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4948830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4948830":"2026-10-26T05:33:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4948830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4975580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4948830","app_id":4948830,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d7370063cb22f21f109df16899787adf796c53c6f49d5132643cb8e380e116dc","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"StowStow는 모든 상자에 무게와 결과가 따르는 물리 기반 창고에 여러분을 안내합니다. 화물을 스캔하고, 폭발을 피하고, 업그레이드 카드를 뽑고, 혼란이 스스로 통제될 때까지 컨베이어 라인을 구축하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Jarhead"}],"developers":[{"name":"J